sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant MainActivity
    participant ViewModel as MainViewModel
    participant Session as SessionManager
    participant Audio as AudioCaptureService
    participant Encoder as AudioEncoder
    participant GW as GatewayConnection
    participant Gateway as OpenClaw Gateway
    participant Email

    Note over MainActivity: 应用启动，WebSocket 已连接

    %% ── 会议开始 ──
    User->>MainActivity: 长按触控板 1.5s
    MainActivity->>ViewModel: onLongPress()
    ViewModel->>Session: startMeeting()
    Session->>Session: state → Recording

    ViewModel->>GW: send(MeetingStartMessage)
    GW->>Gateway: {"type":"meeting_start"}

    ViewModel->>Audio: audioFlow.collect()
    
    loop 每 100ms
        Audio-->>ViewModel: ByteArray (3200 bytes)
        ViewModel->>Encoder: encodeToBase64(pcmChunk)
        Encoder-->>ViewModel: Base64 string
        ViewModel->>GW: send(AudioFrame)
        GW->>Gateway: {"type":"audio_frame","data":"..."}
    end

    Note over Gateway: Whisper 实时转写<br/>HUD 不显示

    %% ── 快速问答 ──
    User->>MainActivity: 双击触控板
    MainActivity->>ViewModel: onDoubleTap()
    ViewModel->>GW: send(QuickQueryMessage)
    GW->>Gateway: {"type":"quick_query"}
    
    Note over Gateway: 取近30s转录<br/>GPT-5.5 搜索+压缩

    Gateway-->>GW: {"type":"query_result","items":["要点1","要点2"]}
    GW-->>ViewModel: QueryResultMessage
    ViewModel->>ViewModel: uiState.queryResult = ...
    Note over ViewModel: 3s 后自动清除

    %% ── 会议结束 ──
    User->>MainActivity: 再次长按 1.5s
    MainActivity->>ViewModel: onLongPress()
    ViewModel->>Audio: stop()
    ViewModel->>Session: endMeeting()
    Session->>Session: state → Ending

    ViewModel->>GW: send(MeetingEndMessage)
    GW->>Gateway: {"type":"meeting_end","durationSeconds":600}

    Note over Gateway: 完整转录 → GPT-5.5 生成摘要<br/>→ SMTP 发送邮件到 lhjjjk4@gmail.com

    Gateway-->>GW: {"type":"summary_sent","documentId":"doc_abc"}
    GW-->>ViewModel: SummarySent
    ViewModel->>Session: reset()
    ViewModel->>ViewModel: uiState.summarySent = true
    Note over ViewModel: 2s 后清除标记

    %% ── 断线重连 ──
    Note over Gateway,GW: ~~~ 网络断开 ~~~
    Gateway--xGW: onFailure
    GW->>GW: connectionState = ERROR
    GW->>GW: delay(backoff_ms)
    Note over GW: 指数退避: 1s→2s→4s→...→30s
    GW->>Gateway: 重连 WebSocket
    Gateway-->>GW: onOpen
    GW->>GW: connectionState = CONNECTED
